    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_cursor" kindref="compound">Cursor</ref> encoding/decoding utilities for pagination.</para>
<para>Cursors encode the last seen primary key or index position to enable stateless pagination. Supports multiple pagination strategies:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Basic cursor pagination (pk-based)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Keyset pagination (ORDER BY value + pk)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_cursor" kindref="compound">Cursor</ref> expiration and versioning</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Format: base64(json({pk, collection, order_value?, created_at, version}))</para>
<para>Security Note: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_cursor" kindref="compound">Cursor</ref> tokens use Base64 encoding (not encryption). This is appropriate for position markers but should not contain sensitive data. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
